    Turnout invokes `claude` (Anthropic Claude Code), `copilot` (GitHub Copilot
    CLI), and `codex` (OpenAI Codex CLI) as local subprocesses. These are not
    redistributed with Turnout, and Turnout neither reads, stores, nor transmits
    their credentials -- each tool authenticates itself under your own account.

    Your use of those tools through Turnout remains subject to each provider's
    own terms of service and acceptable use policy. Automating a subscription
    tool may be treated differently from ordinary interactive use; that is
    between you and the provider.
